<BaseLayout title="About Antique Radio Salvage" description="Learn about Antique Radio Salvage, a Massachusetts vacuum tube buyer, seller and professional testing service." current="about">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">About Antique Radio Salvage</p><h1>Experience, equipment and a genuine interest in preserving vintage electronics.</h1><p class="lead">Antique Radio Salvage is a Massachusetts-based small business specializing in vacuum tubes, professional testing and the purchase of collections and related equipment.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A specialist—not a general antique dealer</p><h2>Built around vacuum tubes and vintage electronics.</h2><p class="lead">Years of buying, testing, identifying, selling and supporting vacuum tubes provide the practical experience needed to evaluate unfamiliar collections and describe tested inventory accurately.</p><p>Our work spans audio tubes, receiving tubes, transmitting tubes, early and collectible types, tube testers, vintage radio parts and related electronics. The approach is straightforward: communicate clearly, use appropriate equipment and treat sellers and customers fairly.</p></div><div class="image-shell"><img src="/images/tube-testing-poster.png" alt="Antique Radio Salvage professional tube testing" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section warm"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">What matters to us</p><h2>A professional, practical approach</h2></div></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Accurate descriptions</h3><p>Testing results and item descriptions should help a buyer understand what is actually being offered.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Fair evaluations</h3><p>Sellers deserve a clear explanation of the process, particularly when handling inherited or unfamiliar material.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Long-term trust</h3><p>Repeat customers and strong feedback are built through careful packing, communication and follow-through.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p><h2>Have tubes, equipment or a testing question?</h2><p>Use the contact form and select the inquiry type that best matches what you need.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
